=================
mcintyre-v-ohio
=================
* Expression -- Anonymity -- McIntyre v. Ohio

In this 1995 U.S. Supreme Court decision, the Court struck down a Ohio
law that banned anonymous campaign literature determining that the law
illegal abridged freedom of speech as protected by the First
Amendment.  The decision was 7-2. Included: official summary, the main
opinion, concurring opinions, and the dissent.

