ny-times-v-sullivan
=================
* Expression -- Libel, Theory of

Excerpts from Supreme Court opinions saying that caustic verbal
attacks and some factual errors must be allowed if freedom of
expression is to have the "breathing space" it needs. Also, that
self-help, that is correcting a lie or error in public, is the
preferred remedy to defamation.


